{
 "_about": "Scripted conversations for Narada. Each case is a list of steps; a step says one thing and checks the reply. new_session clears the chat history (a later conversation); restart rebuilds the agent on the same data (a service restart). Checks are regular expressions, case-insensitive: any = at least one must match the reply, none = none may match, action = must match an action the agent took, no_action = the agent must not have acted. knows = the reply must not say it does not know. voice = the spoken path (short replies). max_chars / min_chars bound the reply length.",
